admin":false},"body":"With both `flush_read_ptr` and `flushing` we can't tell apart re-entrancy (on the same thread) from the case that one thread flushing and another trying to as well. Both situations require different handling. We weren't doing that formerly, so before I added the `sync()` line, the single thread-local `flush_read_ptr` would be enough.","created_at":"2025-12-09T15:13:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T15:13:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113802#discussion_r2603087762","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113802","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2603087762"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113802#discussion_r2603087762"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113802"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2603087762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":110,"original_line":110,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2602872859,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2603342578","pull_request_review_id":3558320386,"id":2603342578,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6bK9ry","diff_hunk":"@@ -107,7 +107,8 @@ class CommandQueueMT {\n \n \tstatic const uint32_t DEFAULT_COMMAND_MEM_SIZE_KB = 64;\n \n-\tbool unique_flusher = false;\n+\tinline static thread_local bool flushing = false;","path":"core/templates/command_queue_mt.h","commit_id":"824287eefb3de4ebe62857c2e24c18b3d18bd89e","original_commit_id":"73805445e8838125378a025ba25934032325b36b","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"h